40
00:02:11,520 --> 00:02:12,860
The word is subscription.

41
00:02:13,160 --> 00:02:22,880
Okay, so if you get a subscription, that means that you are paying money to receive something every month, every week, etc.

42
00:02:22,880 --> 00:02:23,880
That's right.

43
00:02:23,880 --> 00:02:24,640
So the time is fixed.

44
00:02:24,880 --> 00:02:28,360
Like you said, it could be weekly, the time could change.

45
00:02:28,360 --> 00:02:34,530
But basically, you have a promise that after you pay this money, you'll receive something periodically.

46
00:02:34,880 --> 00:02:35,880
Right.

47
00:02:35,880 --> 00:02:41,320
