Exactly.

54
00:02:51,920 --> 00:02:56,510
Or hopefully, EnglishPod, you receive by subscription or you pay the subscription fee.

55
00:02:56,970 --> 00:02:57,110
Exactly.

56
00:02:57,880 --> 00:03:00,400
So with EnglishPod, you subscribe.

57
