So we call these kinds of publications periodicals.

64
00:03:31,740 --> 00:03:32,120
Okay.

65
00:03:32,180 --> 00:03:36,400
So for example, as you said, a newspaper, it comes every day.

66
00:03:36,660 --> 00:03:37,860
That's the period of time.

67
00:03:37,880 --> 00:03:39,140
So it's a periodical.

68
00:03:39,300 --> 00:03:40,000
The same as a magazine.

69
00:03:40,380 --> 00:03:41,620
Sometimes they are weekly.

70
00:03:42,200 --> 00:03:42,820
Sometimes they are monthly.

71
00:03:43,440 --> 00:03:45,450
Is a book a periodical, Pop Quiz?

72
00:03:46,160 --> 00:03:47,160
No.

73
00:03:47,160 --> 00:03:48,160
Okay.

74
00:03:48,160 --> 00:03:48,490
No, because you only get it once.

75
00:03:49,160 --> 00:03:50,160
Right.

76
00:03:50,160 --> 00:03:57,950
So basically, a periodical has to be something, I guess, that comes out every so often, a new version, a new edition.

77
00:03:59,440 --> 00:04:00,690
It's continually updating.

78
00:04:01,160 --> 00:04:01,470
Okay.

79
00:04:02,010 --> 00:04:04,910
So that is periodicals and subscriptions.

80
00:04:05,470 --> 00:04:12,370
Now moving on to when he was trying to sell the magazines, he said, we have a great variety of magazines all about cooking.

81
00:04:13,320 --> 00:04:15,720
So what is a variety?

82
00:04:15,720 --> 00:04:16,720
Variety is a great word.

